ithin capacity 8. So the mapping is possible.\n\nThus answer: Provide mapping in some format, maybe a list or table. Since they ask \"输出 room 映射\", we can output something like:\n\nM1: R2\nM2: R1\nM3: R2\n\nOr as a dictionary: {\"M1\":\"R2\", \"M2\":\"R1\", \"M3\":\"R2\"}.\n\nWe should also note that the mapping respects capacities and overlaps.\n\nThus final answer: Provide mapping. Possibly include explanation? The user didn't ask for explanation, just output. So we can give concise mapping.\n\nThus:\n\n```\nM1 → R2\nM2 → R1\nM3 → R2\n```\n\nOr in Chinese: \"M1 分配到房间 R2，M2 分配到房间 R1，M3 分配到房间 R2。\" Provide that.\n\nI'll include both mapping and brief note. Ensure no extra formatting unless requested. The user didn't specify format, but typical answer is a simple list.\n\nThus final.\n</think>\nM1 → R2  \nM2 → R1  \nM3 → R2",
